    "steps":[
      ["Marinate","Toss the cubed chicken with its seasonings and olive oil."],
      ["Rice","Boil the rice until cooked, drain and set aside."],
      ["Alfredo","Melt the butter over medium heat and cook the garlic and onion 5 minutes until soft. Add the salt and herbs and toast 2 minutes, then add the milk, Parmesan and cream cheese, stirring until smooth and creamy."],
      ["Bake the chicken","Spread the chicken on a lined sheet pan, spray with oil and bake 18 minutes at 200°C / 400°F, then broil 5 minutes until golden."],
      ["Roast the veg","Lift out the chicken, leaving the juices. Add the red onion, sun-dried tomatoes, parsley and seasoning, mix through the juices, flatten and roast 15 minutes."],
      ["Fry the rice","Fold the cooked rice into the pan until colored and fluffy."],
      ["Serve","Serve the rice with the chicken and a pour of Alfredo sauce."]
